    "commit": "9b36bd798",
    "summary": "concept-resolve.ts, module-profile.ts and infra/_shared.ts drop their bare-name lists; directories are pruned by excludesDirectory (the FileFilter walk's own pruning rule, so an unreadable directory is still reported) and files by FileFilter.includes; walkFiles roots its filter at the enclosing git repository. Also fixed a t2 FileFilter defect: .git/ contents were listed as included files (now a built-in exclusion). Wide run of src/indexer + src/analyze: 1464 pass, 2 fail (pinned old SKIP_DIRS note + a no-ignore-file measure fixture), both updated in 9b36bd798 and re-run green."
